%% DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. No content published or advertising budget changed.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Actor as Human / narrow AI workload
  participant M as Marketing service
  participant Identity as Backend identity + scope
  participant Gov as L4/L5 Rule / Decision / Approval
  participant Facts as L3 Facts / Consent / Asset rights
  participant Cap as L10 canonical cap ledger
  participant Q as L6 command / outbox / worker
  participant Native as Scoped channel adapter / provider
  participant R as Receipt + L8 reporting
  Note over Actor,R: DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. C-CONTENT, C-CAMPAIGN, C-ACTION, C-COMMAND, C-RECEIPT.
  Actor->>M: Plan/content/campaign revision + assets + requested action
  M->>Identity: Authenticate actor, membership, delegation, company and target binding
  Identity-->>M: Effective scopes + authority epoch; selector cannot grant access
  M->>Facts: Current content hash / rights expiry / consent / resource revision
  Facts-->>M: Source revisions, evidence and freshness or missing reason
  M->>Gov: Action proposal binding exact target/account/payload/fact refs
  Gov->>Gov: Versioned rules; Pháp → Lệ → Lý → Tình; C0–C3
  alt Invalid scope or hard forbidden
    Gov-->>Actor: REJECTED; cannot enter approval queue to bypass
  else Missing required fact, rights or budget basis
    Gov-->>Actor: WAITING_INPUT + owner/deadline
  else Valid C2 action requiring approval
    Gov-->>Actor: Preview exact digest, rule/fact versions, cap and TTL
    Actor->>Gov: Authorized approver signs same digest + expiry
    Gov->>Gov: Persist immutable approval; C3 framework change handled separately
  else C1 within effective delegation
    Gov->>Gov: Persist bounded authorization + gate trace
  end
  opt Valid current Decision and approval when required
    Gov->>Cap: Reserve scoped exposure with stable obligation key
    Cap-->>Gov: Reservation_ref or CAP_EXCEEDED / CAP_UNSET
    Gov->>Q: Persist Command + hash + ABSENT/MATCH precondition + reservation when required
    Q-->>Actor: 202 command_id + pure receipt_ref; not publish success
    Q->>Q: Atomic claim / lease / monotonic fence
    Q->>Identity: Recheck membership, company status and authority epoch
    Q->>Facts: Recheck revision, consent, asset rights and expected state
    Q->>Gov: Recheck exact hash, rules, approval and TTL
    Q->>Cap: Recheck hold and total exposure
    alt Any decision dependency invalidated
      Q->>R: REJECTED / DECISION_STALE / WAITING_INPUT; no effect
      Q->>Cap: Release only proven unused reservation portion
    else All guards pass
      Q->>Q: Persist DISPATCH_INTENT + effect key before external call
      Q->>Native: Credential-bound target + same effect key; provider limits
      alt Confirmed effect and provider receipt
        Native-->>Q: Native object ID / provider acceptance evidence
        Q->>Native: Readback exact target and operation fingerprint
        Native-->>Q: Current state/evidence
        Q->>R: SUCCEEDED receipt if sufficient; source/native revision
        Q->>Cap: Settle actual; replace matched reservation, no double count
      else Response lost after possible effect
        Q->>R: UNKNOWN; preserve intent + hold
        Q->>Native: Read/reconcile by effect key/native ID
        Note over Q,Native: Never redispatch blindly or generate new command to evade UNKNOWN.
      end
    end
  end
  Actor->>R: GET receipt by command_id
  R-->>Actor: Pure read current state + evidence/as_of; no retry side effect
  Note over M,R: Internal plan APPROVED is separate from native ACTIVE/PUBLISHED. 130m is Marketing cap, no reallocation in design.
